              clone 8de4d6a; plain 02fd1835, sprites 0b10aeb4): match_day.rzx
              6,211 frames and match_day_spectrumcomputing.rzx 50,404 frames
              IDENTICAL (413,300 figure calls, 22.4M sprite pixels, R compared
              at every event, all 26,529 e_objs calls at 0x8194 checked whole
              against the original, IM 1 handler equal at 2,305 menu
              interrupts); pace targets against the original's own T: 166,103
              image builds exact (max 7 T), 166,468 XOR draws mean error 21 T
              of 6,817 (bias +0.01%), crowd copier bias +0.01%; every-site
